{"id":"u-8f6c2bca-755d-48c9-96c3-5c595637d913","src":"community","title":"XLARGE: ULPPL","author":"Joe Ferreri","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/cBiZRh-xlarge-ulppl","desc":"ULPPL program with both strength and size in mind. Goal over the course of the program is to continue to push your limits by increasing the %’s on bench and squat, and progressive overload your accessories. Feel free to replace RDL on the lower day with an actual deadlift if you please, I’d suggest a 3x3 at 85% of your max for weeks 1-4 and then raising it to 87.5% weeks 4-8. Optional: take a deload between weeks 4 and 5 if your CNS is fried. Additionally: after the program, take 2-3 days off and retest your maxes, seen how you progressed. If you didn’t hit a PR, I’d suggest taking a deload for 2 weeks, as your CNS is most likely fried. Run the first first 4 weeks of the program again, and retest.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Strength"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":3,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-06T22:13:30.003Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper","Lower","Rest day","Push","Pull","Legs"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Bench Press (Paused)","sets":[{"r":6,"pct":80,"x":3}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Seated Wide-Grip Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Pull-Up (Bodyweight)","sets":[{"amrap":1,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Pushdown (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":9.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"rpe":9.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hip Adductor (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]},{"n":"Hip Abductor (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":8,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Walk","sets":[{"sec":0}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Bench